          description : "1.2 SOL-11.1-010060"
          info        : "The audit system must support an audit reduction capability.

GROUP ID: V-219988RULE ID: SV-219988r958768

Using the audit system will utilize the audit reduction capability. Without an audit reduction capability, users find it difficult to identify specific patterns of attack."
          solution    : "The Audit Control profile is required.

This action applies to the global zone only. Determine the zone that you are currently securing.

