        <report type:"PASSED">
          description : "1.92 SOL-11.1-040250"
          info        : "The default umask for system and users must be 077.

GROUP ID: V-216106RULE ID: SV-216106r959010

Setting a very secure default value for umask ensures that users make a conscious choice about their file permissions."
          solution    : "The root role is required.

